WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.386
A yaab sẽn lʋɩt saasẽ wã. Yaa kassena lagem-n-taare.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.570
Sẽn be yĩngri, sawadg zugẽ, tẽng sẽn yit yĩngri. A ra pa paoog bũmb ye.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.536
A Kollo yaab-rãmbã ra geta tẽngã sẽn be tẽng zug.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.176
A ne a pagã ra geta dũni kãngã sẽn pa tar zĩiga, wall koɛɛg ye.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.504
La b yãagame t'a Zezi saagd-b lame, la b wa n kẽnga tẽngẽ.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.008
La b ra gũuda yĩngr ne tẽngã sʋka.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.504
Tẽnga ra gũuda bãmb tɩ b ka tõe n yã ye, la Tibɛll na n zĩnda be.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.354
Tẽngã ra yaa kʋɩlenga. La koom sã n ka be, b pa tõe n yik ye.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.744
Sa-kãseng sẽn yit yĩngri, wa-y mam nengẽ!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.096
La sawadgã pukame, la tẽngã rɩka koom.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.552
B maana raag a yiib-n-soaba, la b tʋlg pʋʋgo.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.170
Yaa tẽn-kãng la d pipi n yã. Yʋʋm n loogame, la kom-bɩɩsã rogame.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.176
Pagbã rɩka tẽn-gãongã la kug sẽn yaa balengã, n maneg b gɛyã.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:13.336
B ra rɩkda makr sẽn yit saasẽ tɩ ned pa tõe n yĩm a sẽn yitẽ ye.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.448
Tẽeg-y tɩ d ba yii yĩngri.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:50.144
La kaoosg zugẽ, a Tibɛll naab n na n dogame.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.840
Bõe yĩng tɩ d segd n yeel woto?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.056
Rũndã-rũndã, Tibéla pʋgẽ, pagbã ket n manegda b yirã.
